ble-irrigation-pump48207349098.jpg\"/></span></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"fr\">\n<h1 class=\"title-h1\">Submersible Irrigation Pump</h1>\n<p>submersible irrigation pumps have been designed for maintenance-free long-term operation. Even under difficult conditions, for example fluids containing sand, the wear-resistant materials ensure optimum operation. The motor is...</p>\n<a class=\"special_read\" href=\"#p1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Send Inquiry</a>\n<div class=\"share-btn-list\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"52044812\"/></p><p><strong>submersible irrigation pump</strong><br/></p><p><img alt=\"image007(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231544562744970.jpg\"/></p><p>Submersible irrigation pumps have been designed for maintenance-free long-term operation. Even under difficult conditions, for example fluids containing sand, the wear-resistant materials ensure optimum operation. The motor is perfectly matched to the pump.</p><p><strong>1. Technical data</strong></p><p>• Performance range: Flow up 14.7 m3/h</p><p>• Head up to 224 m</p><p>• Voltage range: 220-415V</p><p>• Frequency: 50/60Hz</p><p>• Max. acceptable media temp: 35 °C</p><p>• Pump diameter: Ø98 mm</p><p>• Thread connections: RP 1’’ – RP 2’’</p><p>• Minimum well diameter: Ø100 mm</p><p>• Materials: Stainless steel casing with plastic impeller</p><p>• The JIADI submersible pumps can be installed vertically or horizontally</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231546093599161.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image009(001).jpg\"/></p><p><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231544558015663.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><p><img alt=\"图片111.jpg\" height=\"1169\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808251509242659366.jpg\" style=\"width: 737px; height: 1169px;\" width=\"737\"/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231546182547767.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image013(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong>4. The submersible irrigation pump also includes</strong></p><p>Starting device with motor protection switch and run capacitor </p><p>Customized length submersible cable with plug </p><p>JIADI control box unit with 1 meter cable and plug for pump monitoring and control.</p><p><strong>5. Operating Application</strong></p><p>For clean water, non-aggressive.</p><p>For water supply.</p><p>For irrigation.</p><p>For civil and industrial applications.</p><p>For fire fighting applications.</p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231546217621419.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image015(001).jpg\"/></p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: submersible irrigation pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\"><img alt=\"Submersible Pump Impeller Design\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-pump-impeller-design44280348583a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-submersible-pump/3-submersible-impeller-pump/submersible-pump-impeller-design\">Submersible Pump Impeller Design</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/3-5-submersible-pump/3-5-inch-submersible-well-water-pump\"><img alt=\"3.5 Inch Submersible Well Water Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-5-inch-submersible-well-water-pump47154201020a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/3-5-submersible-pump/3-5-inch-submersible-well-water-pump\">3.5 Inch Submersible Well Water Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4-ss-submersible-pump/submersible-pre